# Media player. media-video/vlc is here rather than in `graphics` because vlc-4
# is no longer toolkit-neutral: with [gui] (default, and vlc-4 is stable on
# amd64) it builds against dev-qt/qtbase:6, qt5compat, qtdeclarative, qtsvg plus
# kde-frameworks/kwindowsystem and qqc2-desktop-style. vlc-3 had no Qt at all --
# this is upstream drift. Under KDE that stack is already present, so vlc costs
# nothing; under gnome/wm/minimal it would drag the whole Qt6+KF6 layer in for one
# player. `graphics` keeps media-video/mpv, which every flavor can afford
# (measured 2026-09-08).
